flowchart TD
  ROOT[Root translation unit] --> FRAME[Create an include-instance frame]
  FRAME --> INCLUDE[Enter header with parent and directive location]
  INCLUDE --> CHILD[Create child frame]
  CHILD --> LINE[Record logical line and filename for this frame]
  LINE --> TOKEN[Keep spelling expansion and definition locations]
  TOKEN --> ORIGIN[Record exact preprocessed token origin]
  ORIGIN --> AST[Typed source location]
  AST --> DIAG[Text and JSON ranges]
  FRAME --> DIAG
  CHILD --> DIAG
  DIAG --> TRACE[Traverse actual parent include chain]
